 have not drawn much myself recently.\n\nI think it is difficult to understand from the reference material, so I would like to add that the clothes have the texture of work clothes, and the color in the setting is brown (so-called grape color No. 1), which is very close to black. The shirt is drawn with a design similar to that of the boarding doors of the actual car, but I don't know if it is uneven or printed. ......\nThe hair color is grayish rather than silver.\nI would appreciate it if you could make up or cover up the details as you see fit!\n\nThe drawing of her body is not stable enough, so it is hard to tell, but please give her a childish look. (It would be better if it has the atmosphere that Mr. Sanroku usually draws.)\n\nI would like her to have a childlike personality, but she may smile, so any kind of facial expression is fine.\n\nI can leave the pose and composition up to you!　I would like to see the atmosphere you draw!　If it is OK with you, I would be grateful for your cooperation!\n\nhttps://twitter.com/yunikisaha41800/status/1674366686433275909?", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@tab_888/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3314033, "client_id": 1229256, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1abc679c/uploads/origins/82be11dd-a1a1-4fd7-934c-cef1db31dc5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bdbc7c712d0b5c659848fd7f53083a1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1abc679c/uploads/origins/82be11dd-a1a1-4fd7-934c-cef1db31dc5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0bdbc7c712d0b5c659848fd7f53083a1, https://si.imgix.net/1abc679c/uploads/origins/82be11dd-a1a1-4fd7-934c-cef1db31dc5b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25b742cf99f4c14073a2bfa7e5132cac 2x, https